The codebook data originates from the FMOD library; if its owner objects to the redistribution of
these packets, remove the data file and vorbis_setups.rs and use `audio export --vgmstream` instead.

Dependencies with their own licences are listed in docs/DEPENDENCIES.md. `theora-rs` (a Rust port of
libtheora) is used unmodified under the Mozilla Public License 2.0; its source is the published crate
on crates.io (https://crates.io/crates/theora-rs).

